                <run fontcolor='#64748b' fontsize='10'>&#10;Lasalgaon vs Mumbai Onion spread inversion case study: Mumbai lower on 74.75% of 507 matched days (mean -₹157.76/Qtl) due to cultivar reporting heterogeneity.</run>
