                <run fontcolor='#64748b' fontsize='10'>&#10;Two-Way Fixed Effects panel regression with Cameron-Miller cluster-robust standard errors. Onion β = -0.0360 (95% CI [-0.072, -0.0001]); refutes 35-50% price surge folklore.</run>
